The interface fonts, which are not redistributed
------------------------------------------------
IBM Plex Sans Arabic, Reem Kufi, Amiri and Amiri Quran are all under the SIL
Open Font License and none of them is in this repository: index.html links
them from Google Fonts and the browser fetches them.


